  "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_FloatingIslands_header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"549\"></strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此資源包專為「島嶼冒險」模組包打造獨特的載入背景圖片而設計。不過，您也可以自由將其用於其他任何模組包中——它是完全相容的！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要安裝模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loading-backgrounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loading Backgrounds</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_banner1.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>伺服器上也能用嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！它運作得非常完美！請記住，與朋友一起玩模組的最佳方式就是透過 BisectHosting，而<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結即可獲得 25% 折扣</a>。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這個資源包可以用在模組包中嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！只要它僅發布於 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 即可。上傳到其他任何平台都將侵犯我們的權利，是完全不被允許的。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果您考慮將其加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 模組包中，我們會非常感激。如果您需要任何小修改或有任何疑問，請與我們聯絡！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製這個模組的影片並在我的頻道上展示嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以，您完全可以在您的頻道上遊玩這個模組或我們的任何模組包並製作相關影片，事實上，我們對此非常感謝！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_FloatingIslands_screenshot1.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_FloatingIslands_screenshot3.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_FloatingIslands_screenshot4.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_FloatingIslands_screenshot2.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要一個伺服器來和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找一個伺服器來和朋友一起玩任何模組或模組包，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 就是您的解決方案！他們提供品質價格比最佳的 Minecraft 伺服器，而且只要點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>，並使用優惠碼 \"Lupin\"，即可獲得 25% 折扣。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
